🔴 INVALID TEST CASES (10)

Each case answers:

“What happens if the programmer / assembler / runtime makes a mistake?”

❌ I1. Stack underflow (binary op)
ADD
HALT


Bug type: stack underflow
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: stack underflow


Why important:

Validates stack safety

Very common student bug

❌ I2. Stack underflow (unary op)
NEG
HALT


Bug type: unary op on empty stack
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: NEG on empty stack

❌ I3. Division by zero
PUSH 10
PUSH 0
DIV
HALT


Bug type: arithmetic exception
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: division by zero


Critical for robustness marks.

❌ I4. Invalid opcode
.byte 0xAB
HALT


(or however Aditya emits raw bytes)

Bug type: unknown instruction
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: invalid opcode 0xAB


This proves your VM is not trusting input blindly.

❌ I5. LOAD out of bounds
LOAD 999
HALT


Bug type: memory bounds violation
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: LOAD index out of bounds


Same applies to STORE.

❌ I6. STORE out of bounds
PUSH 10
STORE 999
HALT


Bug type: memory corruption prevention
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: STORE index out of bounds

❌ I7. JMP to invalid address
JMP 9999
HALT


Bug type: illegal control flow
Who catches it: VM runtime (PC bounds check)
Expected error:

Runtime error: PC out of bounds


Very important for control-flow safety.

❌ I8. JZ without condition
JZ end
HALT
end:
HALT


Bug type: missing condition on stack
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: stack underflow


Validates JZ contract.

❌ I9. RET without CALL (invalid frame)
RET
HALT


Bug type: invalid stack frame
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: stack underflow


This is extremely important — shows frame discipline.

❌ I10. CALL to non-function (RET mismatch)
CALL f
HALT
f:
ADD
RET


Bug type: callee violates calling convention
Who catches it: VM runtime
Expected error:

Runtime error: stack underflow


Why this matters:

Function didn’t push return value

ABI violation

Shows why calling conventions exist

